<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">叫什么</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="例如 抽纸"
        value="{{form.name}}"
        data-field="name"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="20"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">分类</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="onCategoryChange">
        <view class="picker">{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ›</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">单位</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{units}}" value="{{unitIndex}}" bindchange="onUnitChange">
        <view class="picker">{{units[unitIndex]}} ›</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">品牌</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="选填，例如 清风"
        value="{{form.brand}}"
        data-field="brand"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="20"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">规格</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="选填，例如 3层120抽"
        value="{{form.spec}}"
        data-field="spec"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="20"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{isCreate}}">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">现在家里还剩多少</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="digit"
        placeholder="没有就填 0"
        value="{{form.baseQty}}"
        data-field="baseQty"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="note muted">已经在用的东西填上现有数量，它马上就能开始估算。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">大概能用多久</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        placeholder="选填，单位：天"
        value="{{form.initEstimateDays}}"
        data-field="initEstimateDays"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="chips">
      <text class="chip" data-days="7" bindtap="pickEstimate">一周</text>
      <text class="chip" data-days="15" bindtap="pickEstimate">半个月</text>
      <text class="chip" data-days="30" bindtap="pickEstimate">一个月</text>
      <text class="chip" data-days="90" bindtap="pickEstimate">三个月</text>
      <text class="chip" data-days="180" bindtap="pickEstimate">半年</text>
    </view>
    <view class="note muted" wx:if="{{hint}}">{{hint}}</view>
    <view class="note muted" wx:else>填一个大概数字就行，纯粹是冷启动用。记满两三次购买之后，它会用你真实的消耗速度覆盖掉这个估计。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <button class="btn btn-plain save-btn" bindtap="cancel">取消</button>
    <button
      class="btn btn-primary save-btn {{saving ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}"
      bindtap="save"
      disabled="{{saving}}"
    >
      {{saving ? '保存中…' : '保存'}}
    </button>
  </view>
  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
